sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Sender
  participant D as Data store
  participant Q as Message channel
  participant R as Receiver
  S->>D: 1. Write payload
  D-->>S: Write succeeded
  S->>Q: 2. Send claim check
  Q->>R: 3. Deliver claim check
  R->>D: 4. Fetch payload with claim check
  D-->>R: Payload